msgid ""
"Inventory adjustment underway at the following location(s):\n"
"- %(locations)s\n"
"Product '%(product)s' is included in the inventory. Moving it to/from these locations is not allowed until the adjustment is complete."
msgstr ""
"Inventura poteka na naslednjih lokacijah:\n"
"- %(locations)s\n"
"Proizvod '%(product)s' je vključen v zalogo. Premikanje na te lokacije/iz "
"njih ni dovoljeno, dokler inventura ni končana."

